{"id":56693,"date":"2026-08-03T11:42:35","date_gmt":"2026-08-03T10:42:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-4-estacoes-primavera-condeixa\/"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:49:44","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:49:44","slug":"corrida-4-estacoes-outono-condeixa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-4-estacoes-outono-condeixa\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es Outono Condeixa 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es Outono Condeixa 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es Outono Condeixa 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de <strong>25 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida \u00e0s <strong>10:30<\/strong> no <strong>Jardim dos Pa\u00e7os do Munic\u00edpio<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica vila de <strong>Condeixa-a-Nova<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Integrada no prestigiado circuito <em>Corrida 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es Portugal<\/em>, a etapa de Outono \u00e9 organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es<\/strong> com o apoio institucional da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Condeixa.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes optar pela veloz <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada por chip eletr\u00f3nico com caixas de partida organizadas por ritmo ou participar na animada <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de conv\u00edvio para todas as idades (com tarifa especial para crian\u00e7as at\u00e9 aos 12 anos). O tra\u00e7ado plano percorre art\u00e9rias urbanas e hist\u00f3ricas de Condeixa com abastecimento aos 5 km e na linha de meta.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura dorsal com chip timing, diploma eletr\u00f3nico de finalista, medalha comemorativa oficial da temporada de outono, seguro desportivo e balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes no Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo de Condeixa.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-tra